  "$description": "Copy of synaptiq to adjust on the vk/adjustments branch. Synaptiq: the Synaptiq brand on its own anatomy, reverse-engineered from synaptiq.ai (HubSpot theme CSS, read 2026-10-06: Quicksand body, Lust and Museo Slab headings, Jasper links and 3px calls to action, #F7F6F7 fields) and the Synaptiq Design System (tokens, 2-4px radii, Soil-tinted shadows, ALL-CAPS captions tracked 0.08em, no gradients). Licensed faces are replaced by the brand guide's own Google alternates. Atlas's look (2026-11-19): wider spacing, pill controls, a major-second type scale from a 20px body, 20px card corners, edgeless fields, Arctic titles and the Synaptiq icon library.",
